# Gold evaluation corpus — one URL per line, prefixed with its sampling stratum.
#
#   S1  Semantic          <main>/<nav>/<article> + at least one explicit role=
#   S2  Div-soup          zero HTML5 landmarks, >=200 <div>
#   S3  Framework         React/Vue/Tailwind class-soup, hydrated markup
#   S4  Reference/docs    long, deep heading tree, table of contents
#   S5  App-like          forms, controls, dialogs, tables
#
# The plan (docs/parser-evaluation-plan.md §2.1) calls for 12 randomly sampled
# pages per stratum, drawn from a public crawl slice and filtered by the stratum
# predicate — NOT hand-picked. `classifyStratum()` in fetch-corpus.ts implements
# the predicates; use it to filter a candidate list, and record every rejection
# and its reason.
#
# Lines added here are recorded as `sampling: "random"` in the manifest, so only
# put a URL here if it came out of the sampling procedure. Pages adopted with
# `--adopt` are recorded as `sampling: "convenience"` and are marked as such in
# every report.

# Drawn by `npm run gold:sample` from CC-MAIN-2026-34, seed 11.
# See gold-corpus/sampling-log.json for every draw and every rejection.
S5 https://www.asplinstudio.com/photographe/dsc_2591/
S4 https://www.asportsu.com/product/george-outdoor-bench/
S3 https://forums.mangadex.org/threads/super-no-ura-de-yani-suu-futari-ch-60.2652618/
S4 https://solplanet.net/ua/successcases/rooftop-pv-solution-in-new-south-wales
